  "todo.projectHint": "No working directory for this session \u2014 workspace todos unavailable (life/work/today only).",
  "todo.help": "Todos are browsed in three levels (class \u2192 group \u2192 items): level 1 picks a class (Session / Workspace / Global), level 2 picks a group of that class (the Global class also ends with \u201CPast\u201D and \u201CArchive\u201D), level 3 is the item list; \u201CAll\u201D on level 1 is the cross-group summary. Groups (tracks): Session=this session only; This workspace=the current working directory's todos (invisible from other dirs); Global=shared across sessions; Today=today's tasks (one file per day). Past daily todos (earlier days) are not loaded by default \u2014 open the \u201CPast\u201D cell under the Global class or tick \u201CShow expired\u201D to query history (expired leftovers stay hidden until then). Archived items are listed per group under the \u201CArchive\u201D cell and can be restored. To add: type content, optionally pick a quadrant (important \xD7 urgent) and a due date, then hit Add \u2014 or just tell me \u201Cadd a todo, it's for work/life/this workspace/today\u201D and I will file it in the right group.",
